const HOME="<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\" data-probe-ready=\"false\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Browser evidence tools. Inspect battery reporting, observe discharge and review environment signals with honest, reproducible results.\"><title>Browser evidence lab · Browser Checks</title><style>:root{color-scheme:dark;--bg:#0b1010;--panel:#111919;--line:#263434;--muted:#9aafaa;--ink:#eaf4ef;--mint:#b5f5c7}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:15px/1.6 system-ui,sans-serif}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}a:hover{color:var(--mint)}button,select{font:inherit}button,.button{border:1px solid var(--mint);border-radius:6px;background:var(--mint);color:#102117;padding:10px 18px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:650}button:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:default}.secondary,select{background:transparent;color:var(--ink);border:1px solid var(--line);padding:10px 14px;border-radius:6px}header{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}nav{max-width:1200px;margin:auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:23px 30px}.brand{font-weight:750;font-size:17px;letter-spacing:-.5px}.mark{color:var(--mint);margin-right:10px}nav .links{display:flex;gap:28px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}main{max-width:1200px;margin:auto;padding:54px 30px 90px}.eyebrow{font:11px/1.5 ui-monospace,monospace;letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--mint);text-transform:uppercase}h1{font-size:clamp(34px,5vw,60px);font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-2.7px;line-height:1.08;margin:17px 0 20px;max-width:850px}h2{font-size:21px;letter-spacing:-.5px;font-weight:550;margin:0}h3{font-size:17px;font-weight:550}p{color:var(--muted);max-width:780px}.intro{max-width:710px;font-size:17px}.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:30px;margin-bottom:35px}.pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font:11px ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--mint);padding:7px 10px;border:1px solid #35543d;border-radius:30px}.dot{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--mint)}.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:32px}.card,.panel{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:27px}.card{display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:285px}.card.featured{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#182b22,#111919);border-color:#486b50}.card .num{font:12px ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--muted)}.card h2{margin-top:34px}.card p{font-size:14px}.card .go{margin-top:auto;color:var(--mint)}.toolbar{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:30px 0}label{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;margin:24px 0}.stat{background:var(--panel);padding:22px}.stat span{font:10px ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:1px}.stat strong{display:block;font-size:32px;font-weight:500;margin-top:8px;letter-spacing:-1px}.stat small{color:var(--muted);font-size:11px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.9fr;gap:20px}.section-title{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin:38px 0 18px}.battery{height:76px;border:2px solid #486350;border-radius:10px;padding:6px;position:relative;margin:22px 14px 20px 0}.battery:after{content:'';position:absolute;right:-10px;top:22px;width:6px;height:25px;background:#486350;border-radius:0 3px 3px 0}.battery>div{height:100%;background:var(--mint);border-radius:4px;min-width:2px}.meter-title{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}.big{font-size:32px;letter-spacing:-1px}dl{margin:18px 0 0;font-size:12px}dl>div{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:10px 0}dt{color:var(--muted)}dd{margin:0}svg.chart{display:block;width:100%;height:150px;margin-top:12px}figcaption{font:11px ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--muted)}.table-wrap{overflow:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:13px}th{text-align:left;font:10px ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:1px;background:#14201b}th,td{padding:16px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);vertical-align:top}td:first-child{width:21%;min-width:160px}td:nth-child(2){font:11px ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--mint);width:130px}td:last-child{color:var(--muted)}tr:last-child td{border:0}.notice{border-left:2px solid #6e9b76;padding:2px 0 2px 20px;margin:30px 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}.notice strong{color:var(--ink)}details{margin-top:15px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;padding:18px}summary{cursor:pointer}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;word-break:break-word;font:12px/1.6 ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--muted);max-height:450px;overflow:auto}.sources a{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px;margin-right:20px;font-size:13px}.pending{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:35px;background:var(--panel);margin-top:30px}.pending strong{font-size:20px;font-weight:500}progress{width:100%;accent-color:var(--mint);height:7px;margin-top:25px}.pending small{display:block;color:var(--muted);margin-top:12px}footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:24px 30px;color:var(--muted);font:11px ui-monospace,monospace;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px}#verdict{font-size:22px;letter-spacing:-.5px}#verdict[data-tone=warn]{color:#ffcc8d}[hidden]{display:none!important}@media(max-width:760px){nav{padding:20px}.links a:last-child{display:none}main{padding:36px 20px 60px}.top{display:block}.top>.pill{margin-top:12px}.cards,.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.stats{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.card{min-height:240px}h1{letter-spacing:-1.5px}td,th{padding:12px}footer{flex-direction:column}.panel{padding:20px}}\n</style></head><body><header><nav><a class=\"brand\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"mark\">▣</span>SCRAPETRACE <span style=\"font-weight:400;color:var(--muted)\">/ checks</span></a><div class=\"links\"><a href=\"/\">All tools</a><a href=\"/battery\">Battery</a><a href=\"/environment\">Environment</a></div></nav></header><main><div class=\"top\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">Browser evidence lab / 001</div><h1>See what your<br>browser is telling you.</h1><p class=\"intro\">Small, focused tools to inspect browser signals. Go beyond a single reading, observe behavior, and keep the evidence behind every conclusion.</p></div><span class=\"pill\"><span class=\"dot\"></span> LOCAL OBSERVATION</span></div><div class=\"section-title\"><h2>The toolkit</h2><span class=\"eyebrow\">03 tools / ready to run</span></div><div class=\"cards\"><a class=\"card featured\" href=\"/battery\"><span class=\"num\">01 / POWER</span><h2>Battery integrity</h2><p>Inspect reported battery values. Look for contradictions and observe whether the reported level actually falls over time.</p><span class=\"go\">Run battery test ↗</span></a><a class=\"card\" href=\"/environment\"><span class=\"num\">02 / ENVIRONMENT</span><h2>Browser environment</h2><p>Review automation disclosure, screen, hardware hints, timezone and API availability in one exportable report.</p><span class=\"go\">Inspect environment ↗</span></a><a class=\"card\" href=\"/battery/workload\"><span class=\"num\">03 / ACTIVE EXPERIMENT</span><h2>Battery workload response</h2><p>Compare 30 seconds idle, 30 seconds of bounded CPU/GPU work, and 30 seconds of recovery.</p><span class=\"go\">Run workload test ↗</span></a></div><div class=\"notice\"><strong>Evidence, with limits.</strong><br>A webpage cannot prove that a battery is physical or rule out sophisticated spoofing. A changing reading can be simulated. Unchanged readings, unsupported APIs and privacy defaults are inconclusive.</div><details id=\"methodology\"><summary>Methodology & sources</summary><p>We inspect value ranges and charging/time relationships, repeated object identity, the exposed API surface, a fresh same-origin iframe, battery events, and passive time-series samples. We do not drain the battery with artificial CPU or GPU work. To gather stronger behavioral evidence, unplug your device, keep the tab visible and use a longer observation. Battery estimates are approximate and browsers may round or obfuscate values.</p><p>The default 100%, charging, 0 seconds to full and infinite discharge time can represent a full battery, absent hardware or unavailable information. Native-looking APIs and matching realms are weak evidence. Automation disclosure is reported separately.</p><p>Reports stay in memory and are replaced on reload. Cloudflare receives ordinary page requests and temporary network gates; browser readings are not uploaded. Without JavaScript, checks do not execute. A load-blocking finalizer holds DOMContentLoaded and load until the report is ready. Three pending fetches prevent networkidle0/networkidle2 from settling before load and report completion. For selector waits, use <code>#probe-complete</code>. Choose a navigation timeout longer than the observation plus 10 seconds.</p><div class=\"sources\"><a href=\"https://www.w3.org/TR/battery-status/\">W3C Battery Status API ↗</a><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Navigator/getBattery\">API access & compatibility ↗</a><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Navigator/webdriver\">Automation disclosure ↗</a></div></details></main><footer><span>SCRAPETRACE / BROWSER EVIDENCE LAB</span><span>No analytics. Browser readings stay in this tab unless you export them.</span></footer>\n</body></html>";
